-- `std.time` (spec/26 §2), edition 0.4: the units of time. The constants `millisecond`,
-- `second` and `minute` are built-in names of this module (ADR 0116 rule 0, amended
-- 2026-10-19), since Una declares no module-level values.
module std.time

--- A second, the base unit of time.
pub measure Second

--- A thousandth of a second, the unit of every duration of the host's clock and driver.
pub measure Millisecond = Second / 1000

--- Sixty seconds.
pub measure Minute = 60 * Second
